1
00:00:00,947 --> 00:00:05,787
(Sheldon:)What's wrong? Is she upsetting you?
Because I can make her go away.

2
00:00:06,953 --> 00:00:10,783
No, she's the only reason
I've stayed this long.

3
00:00:12,926 --> 00:00:14,116
(Leonard:)Then what is it?

4
00:00:14,628 --> 00:00:17,218
(Arthur:)I don't know. I think I'm just...

5
00:00:17,464 --> 00:00:22,454
(Arthur:)I just don't want to be
Professor Proton anymore.

6
00:00:23,170 --> 00:00:27,300
(Sheldon:)Well, how can you say that?
Professor Proton's the best.

7
00:00:28,041 --> 00:00:30,241
(Arthur:)What has it ever gotten me?

8
00:00:30,443 --> 00:00:36,743
I mean, I'm an 83-year-old man
who has potatoes in his suitcase.

9
00:00:37,584 --> 00:00:40,144
Other scientists think I'm ajoke.

10
00:00:40,787 --> 00:00:45,987
And the puppeteer who did Gino...

11
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:49,150
(Arthur:)...well, he also...

12
00:00:50,831 --> 00:00:52,821
(Arthur:)...did my wife.

13
00:00:57,671 --> 00:01:04,021
Mr. Jeffries, I need to show you something.

